"app.whatsNew.summary" = "On macOS 27, the icons in ClipMenu 2's menus show again.";
"app.whatsNew.fixed1" = "On macOS 27, ClipMenu 2's menus had lost their icons. Snippets, snippet folders, History folders and actions showed none, and neither did About, Check for Updates, Settings and Quit. All of them show their icons again. Earlier versions of macOS look the same as before.";
"app.whatsNew.changed1" = "Updated to DragonKit 4.3.0, the shared framework behind Settings, About, What's New and software updates. The icons on About, Check for Updates, Settings and Quit come back through it.";
